              "message": {
                "text": "evidence:webhook-can-recover"
              },
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "artifacts/api-server/src/routes/payments-webhook.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "endLine": 105,
                  "startLine": 98
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "A successful retry cannot clear an earlier failed order through browser verification\n\nWhen a failed attempt is followed by a successful checkout on the same order, `/verify` rejects the valid signed success with 409 because it only promotes `created` rows. If the capture webhook is late or missing, login and HOD approval continue to return 402.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Payment state machine reliability\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-841\n\nRemediation:\nUse one shared, idempotent payment-finalization path for browser verification and webhooks. After authoritative provider verification, permit legitimate failed-to-paid recovery; retain explicit protections for refunded orders and owner mismatches.\n\nRemediation tests:\n- Failed attempt then valid successful retry with no captured webhook must recover.\n- Refused/invalid signature must leave state unchanged.\n- Refunded orders must not be resurrected.\n- Concurrent success callbacks must remain idempotent."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:78449e1c4b0da1dd6a2fe43660cc584e7ded6e8745bcc7293d4831c5b540bf47",
            "primaryLocationLineHash": "9238856763a72061:1"
          },
          "properties": {
            "category": "Payment state-machine reliability",
            "confidence": "high",
            "findingId": "csf_5987e4bc56a66d2f62f5bc92",
            "occurrenceId": "occ_dab3f859ab529c26ed89e24c",
            "severity": "medium"
          },
          "ruleId": "payment-verify-rejects-failed-retry",
          "ruleIndex": 3
        },
        {
          "level": "note",
          "locations": [
